ConvNeXt and ConvNeXt V2
-----------------------

The 40 ConvNeXt V1 checkpoints were converted from timm and retain their
upstream Apache License 2.0 terms. The 26 ConvNeXt V2 checkpoints are
Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates and retain the Creative
Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International terms for model weights.
The V2 repository's MIT software license does not apply to its model weights.

Equimo converted the parameters to its JAX/Equinox layout and archive format.
Each archive records its timm tag, upstream Hugging Face commit, preprocessing
configuration, and numerical conversion checks. Sources and bundled licenses
are linked in README.md. No endorsement by the upstream authors is implied.
